# #163 Pit Lord: three jab presses play the jab chain, then a forward tilt
# plays once. Pit Lord a against Pit Lord b, which runs in to about 60 away and
# stands. Syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero pit lord
40 b stick -1 0
70 b stick 0 0
150 a tap A 2
+9 a tap A 2
+9 a tap A 2
+60 a press LB
+0 a stick 0.6 0
+2 a tap A 2
+3 a stick 0 0
+2 a release LB
320 a tap VIEW 70
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the 2-jab chain (styles 0, 20), each a hit, then one forward tilt (style 6).
#! expect a 150 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect b 156 damage 6.000
#! expect a 163 applied attack 2 style 20
#! expect b 170 damage 13.000
#! expect a 230 applied attack 3 style 6
#! expect b 242 damage 28.000
